00:40:33.750 --> 00:40:35.370
Of course, it's absolutely true.

00:40:35.370 --> 00:40:38.020
And Rory's right about this, that

00:40:38.020 --> 00:40:42.240
they're repressing at home
and I think human rights

00:40:42.240 --> 00:40:45.760
are of considerable use in thinking about

00:40:45.760 --> 00:40:47.451
