peasants into, you know

00:41:17.290 --> 00:41:19.500
capitalism that does, it doesn't seem

00:41:19.500 --> 00:41:22.021
like we're anywhere
close to that situation.

00:41:22.021 --> 00:41:22.907
- And so-

00:41:22.907 --> 00:41:23.900
- Please Rory, please.

00:41:23.900 --> 00:41:27.131
- Just, I mean, look my
sympathies are with you

00:41:27.131 --> 00:41:32.131
on this, but I think
that one of the oddities

